    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/239b6f5765ea53fb0422ac481b88a7e0.avif?t=1754477884\" data-has-big width=800 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh hi !<br>You're the new intern right ?... Good good.<br>There are two rules in this company : Do your job and stay at your place.<br>Remember this, and it will all go down nicely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now here is your gun and your contract. The elevator is just down the corridor. You got work to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/f8de3c3842683d4e4f9d4fd3527d8a6b.poster.avif?t=1754477884\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/f8de3c3842683d4e4f9d4fd3527d8a6b.webm?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/f8de3c3842683d4e4f9d4fd3527d8a6b.mp4?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You got back ! Not yet burned out hey ?... Oh, it will come soon, enough.   <br>Good thing you brought back some resources ! This office could really use an upgrade or two.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/a732762fbfc189e5ec985e6bd5a0e784.poster.avif?t=1754477884\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/a732762fbfc189e5ec985e6bd5a0e784.webm?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/a732762fbfc189e5ec985e6bd5a0e784.mp4?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're going back in ? If you find colleagues down there, tell them I said hi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/5668eb311ca28f50bc7e3c451a539de4.poster.avif?t=1754477884\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/5668eb311ca28f50bc7e3c451a539de4.webm?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/5668eb311ca28f50bc7e3c451a539de4.mp4?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, what you got here ?! I'm not sure this is allowed... You should put it back where you found it and pretend it does not exist.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/376ed415fa9aea3326cc5106cde6df00.poster.avif?t=1754477884\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/376ed415fa9aea3326cc5106cde6df00.webm?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/376ed415fa9aea3326cc5106cde6df00.mp4?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damn, where are we ?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/48a87d8d172f52ccb90ebd7b806afd68.poster.avif?t=1754477884\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/48a87d8d172f52ccb90ebd7b806afd68.webm?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/48a87d8d172f52ccb90ebd7b806afd68.mp4?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've got a message from upstairs. It says &quot;You should wishlist the game.&quot; Whatever that means...<br> <br>Game By Maxence Jacquot <br>Music By Julien Ramirez</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/239b6f5765ea53fb0422ac481b88a7e0.avif?t=1754477884\" data-has-big width=800 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh hi !<br>You're the new intern right ?... Good good.<br>There are two rules in this company : Do your job and stay at your place.<br>Remember this, and it will all go down nicely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now here is your gun and your contract. The elevator is just down the corridor. You got work to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/f8de3c3842683d4e4f9d4fd3527d8a6b.poster.avif?t=1754477884\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/f8de3c3842683d4e4f9d4fd3527d8a6b.webm?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/f8de3c3842683d4e4f9d4fd3527d8a6b.mp4?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You got back ! Not yet burned out hey ?... Oh, it will come soon, enough.   <br>Good thing you brought back some resources ! This office could really use an upgrade or two.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/a732762fbfc189e5ec985e6bd5a0e784.poster.avif?t=1754477884\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/a732762fbfc189e5ec985e6bd5a0e784.webm?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/a732762fbfc189e5ec985e6bd5a0e784.mp4?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're going back in ? If you find colleagues down there, tell them I said hi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/5668eb311ca28f50bc7e3c451a539de4.poster.avif?t=1754477884\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/5668eb311ca28f50bc7e3c451a539de4.webm?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/5668eb311ca28f50bc7e3c451a539de4.mp4?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, what you got here ?! I'm not sure this is allowed... You should put it back where you found it and pretend it does not exist.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/376ed415fa9aea3326cc5106cde6df00.poster.avif?t=1754477884\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/376ed415fa9aea3326cc5106cde6df00.webm?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/376ed415fa9aea3326cc5106cde6df00.mp4?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damn, where are we ?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/48a87d8d172f52ccb90ebd7b806afd68.poster.avif?t=1754477884\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/48a87d8d172f52ccb90ebd7b806afd68.webm?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/48a87d8d172f52ccb90ebd7b806afd68.mp4?t=1754477884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've got a message from upstairs. It says &quot;You should wishlist the game.&quot; Whatever that means...<br> <br>Game By Maxence Jacquot <br>Music By Julien Ramirez</p>",
